### Actualizar vehiculo (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/vehiculos/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Toyota Fortuner 2024",
  "descripcion": "Actualizado",
  "empresa_id": 1,
  "tipo_vehiculo_id": 1,
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Actualizar vehiculo parcial (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/vehiculos/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descripcion": "Nueva descripcion parcial"
}
